# CLI maintenance tools (load test, golden-master harness).
#
# Deliberately untracked so they can never reach a server. loadtest.php mints valid
# WordPress auth cookies for arbitrary players; the safest version of that file is one
# that isn't there. They stay on the developer's machine only - a checkout of this
# repo is a clean theme with no tooling in the document root.
tools/
